            <div xml:id="d180">

                <pb facs="0262" n="196" sameAs="frus:frus1934v05/pg196"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.51/4060: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Schoenfeld</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Santo
                                Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-02-05T16:00:00-05:00">February 5, 1934—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:34 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7. My despatch No. 1419, February 1.<anchor n="12" xml:id="d180-f1"/> Rickard
                    informs me he is leaving for Washington by air tomorrow via Miami under
                    instructions of the President to endeavor to expedite negotiations with Foreign
                    Bondholders Protective Council regarding Dominican debt question.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Schoenfeld</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
